<description>&lt;p&gt;A blaze on Phuket island killed 11 people and injured dozens, prompting an investigation into its cause. Thailand deployed two F-16 jets to Mae Hong Son and another pair to the Myanmar border in response to air activity by the Myanmar air force. Thailand offered to send scientists to Myanmar to address toxic pollution in border rivers while Cambodia urged Thailand to respect sovereignty and border agreements, and Thailand rejected Cambodian wording on displaced people at an ASEAN meeting. Trade negotiations between Trump and Thailand remain unresolved, and Indonesia, the Philippines and Thailand are exploring cross-border oil access to strengthen energy security. 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/live/2026/11/17/world/trump-asean-summit/trumps-trade-deal-with-thailand-is-not-a-done-deal&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Indonesia Business Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNSHFRU25XeE9yYnJ3dEsxS0pVMXREc1pMMjkybnVpWDhvSzN0Zk9kLWJQN3R2Z0NhUUUwdWU1SWlrcDNQWThaTENTV2pRTWRwLXA2ampCa2xVR0xWRzMwMG1SMVVqX1hJbkwwUWFwdDNPaEp3dmRyWTNnNFAtRDRQQUNiNE11REtkNThQQ1Jpc3Q1SmRla3hITThnYmdYVmdZNHNsbnZrdWtMc0o1N2Q3bmRB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khaosod English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQX0wweVptb1ltYUlERWhwdEwxazY3LUIyTm5rQ1Q3UnhVN2V5dkJndnh4T0dXQ05BZS1wQUhUQ1RfQkhueUJxMTI5UnhrX2xwdjdZUFNjQWh5LU04d05McUlzRmk4TUxJSzdRTURoR2ZJb29PbDJZYngzVTVjNUxmanhmSHQ3dUxJLXhMeWV0Q3BldXR2cEg4UU83VVV1SVV4Xzk2T2xwVGhwMHZ6NzdVWXZKQ2NuMFpv?oc=5&quot;&gt;CamboJA News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;ht